    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Uncover the truth or lose yourself trying.</strong><br><i>Cecil Hollow</i> is a short, narrative-driven sci-fi horror game set deep in the hills of modern-day Kentucky. When strange activity resurfaces at a long-abandoned farm, you're sent in with state-of-the-art tools to investigate a mystery that\u2019s haunted the region for decades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Something is out there.<br>But what?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Track clues scattered across the property\u2014footage, frequencies, distortions in the air itself. Locals whisper about extraterrestrials. Others suspect government experiments. Some say it's just old ghost stories.<br>The deeper you dig, the more the lines blur.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And the anomaly?<br>It doesn\u2019t want to be found.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your equipment will fail. Your senses will betray you. The further you go, the less you\u2019ll trust what you see or what you remember. Every decision shapes your outcome. Will you unravel the truth? Or become part of the legend?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be safe out there.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Inspired by true events.</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Uncover the truth or lose yourself trying.</strong><br><i>Cecil Hollow</i> is a short, narrative-driven sci-fi horror game set deep in the hills of modern-day Kentucky. When strange activity resurfaces at a long-abandoned farm, you're sent in with state-of-the-art tools to investigate a mystery that\u2019s haunted the region for decades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Something is out there.<br>But what?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Track clues scattered across the property\u2014footage, frequencies, distortions in the air itself. Locals whisper about extraterrestrials. Others suspect government experiments. Some say it's just old ghost stories.<br>The deeper you dig, the more the lines blur.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And the anomaly?<br>It doesn\u2019t want to be found.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your equipment will fail. Your senses will betray you. The further you go, the less you\u2019ll trust what you see or what you remember. Every decision shapes your outcome. Will you unravel the truth? Or become part of the legend?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be safe out there.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Inspired by true events.</strong></p>",
    "short_description": "Venture to Cecil Hollow and investigate the strange events that have driven away the previous owners. Cecil Hollow is a sci-fi horror game with a rich atmosphere set in modern day Kentucky.",
